# Klantenservice.ai — Project Context

AI-powered phone customer service platform. Dutch B2B SaaS. Companies connect their phone number, configure an AI worker, and the AI handles inbound calls using ElevenLabs voice + RAG knowledge base.

## User preferences

- Keep UI text SHORT. No verbose copy. The user hates long text.
- Dutch for all customer-facing text. English for code/comments.
- Minimal changes — don't over-engineer.

## Tech stack

**Backend:** Python 3.11, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy (PostgreSQL + pgvector), Pydantic v2, Alembic migrations
**Frontend:** Next.js 14 (App Router), React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Zustand, React Query, Axios
**Deploy:** Render (separate services for API + Web). Auto-deploy on web, manual on API.
**External services:** ElevenLabs (voice AI), Twilio (telephony), Stripe (billing), OpenAI (embeddings + orchestrator), Resend (email), Google/Microsoft (calendar OAuth), HubSpot (CRM), Plausible (analytics)

## Monorepo structure

```
backend/
  app/
    api/v1/endpoints/    # FastAPI routers (auth, payments, webhooks, admin, ai_workers, etc.)
    core/                # config.py (Settings), security.py (JWT), email.py
    models/              # SQLAlchemy models (company, user, ai_worker, call_log, etc.)
    services/            # Business logic (orchestrator, call_tools, billing_helpers, transcript_service)
      indexing/          # Website crawl + chunk + embed pipeline
      retrieval/         # RAG hybrid search (vector + fulltext + rerank)
frontend/
  src/
    app/                 # Next.js App Router pages
      dashboard/         # Authenticated dashboard pages
      admin/             # Superadmin panel (tabs: overview, analytics, customers, policies, evaluations, voice, logs)
    components/
      layout/            # DashboardLayout, Sidebar, Header, PublicHeader
      ui/                # Custom components (Button, Input, Card, Modal, Badge — NOT shadcn)
    lib/
      api.ts             # Axios client + all API modules (authApi, dashboardApi, paymentsApi, adminApi, etc.)
      store.ts           # Zustand stores (useAuthStore, useSidebarStore)
      utils.ts           # cn(), date helpers, formatters
```

